  </ul>
</div>

<!-- SECTION 1: MARKET OVERVIEW -->
<section id="market-overview">
  <h2>1. Market Overview & Listing Composition</h2>
  <p>The secondary smartwatch market in Q1 2026 comprises <strong>{s['total_listings']:,} active listings</strong> across {s['unique_sellers']:,} unique sellers in {s['countries']} countries. Apple dominates listing volume, but Garmin and Samsung show distinct pricing and geographic patterns that create differentiated opportunity sets.</p>

  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-value">{s['total_listings']:,}</div><div class="kpi-label">Total Listings</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-value">{s['unique_sellers']:,}</div><div class="kpi-label">Unique Sellers</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-value">{s['countries']}</div><div class="kpi-label">Countries</div></div>
